lear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">5. 再次使用以下方式安裝 mixOmics 套件</p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">requireNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BiocManager&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quietly </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">  install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BiocManager&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#606\">BiocManager</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mixOmics&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></div></code></div><br>6. plsda 函數測試結果正常.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div>library(mixOmics)</div><div><br></div><div>data(breast.tumors)</div><div>X &lt;- breast.tumors$gene.exp</div><div>Y &lt;- breast.tumors$sample$treatment</div><div><br></div><div>plsda.breast &lt;- plsda(X, Y, ncomp = 2)</div><div>plotIndiv(plsda.breast, ind.names = TRUE, ellipse = TRUE, legend = TRUE)</div></font></div></code></div><div><br></div>測試結果:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/attach/27fe05a31241c/plsda.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"plsda.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p><div># end</div><br>Yan-Cheng Liu於 2020年6月6日星期六 UTC+8下午9時32分05秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">各位大大 我要使用PLSDA這個方法 可是不知道是在哪個<a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mixOmics/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mixOmics/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237184763000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1F5tCiblQ75EinfS2STYDf\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/mixOmics/index.html</a>套件 要如何下載</div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
