olor:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#080\">mixOmics&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span></div></div></div></code></div></div></div>"
